from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=6,prereqs=[3,5],lead=P("Choose representations by the operations you need: arrays, linked lists, stacks, queues and hash tables.","按所需操作选择表示：数组、链表、栈、队列与哈希表。"),before=P("Know references and operation counts. The labs introduce classes: self names the current instance; an attribute stores its state.","了解引用与操作计数。实验介绍类：self 表示当前实例，属性保存状态。"),outcomes=[P("Compare indexed and linked storage.","比较索引与链接存储。"),P("Implement a linked stack.","实现链式栈。"),P("Use FIFO queues.","使用先进先出队列。"),P("Resolve hash collisions.","解决哈希碰撞。"),P("Explain amortised costs.","解释摊还成本。")],sections=[
S("Abstract data types and representation","抽象数据类型与表示","<p>An abstract data type specifies operations and behaviour; a data structure implements them. A stack promises last-in-first-out removal regardless of whether it uses an array or links. Separate the operation contract from its cost. Choose around workload: frequent indexed reads, front removals, key lookups and ordered scans favour different structures. An implementation should also specify empty behaviour, duplicate policy and ownership of mutable values.</p>","<p>抽象数据类型规定操作与行为，数据结构实现它们。栈承诺后进先出，无论用数组还是链接。需区分操作约定与成本，按索引读取、头部删除、键查询或顺序扫描等工作负载选择，还要规定空情况、重复策略与可变值所有权。</p>","Is FIFO a representation or a behavioural rule?","FIFO 是表示还是行为规则？","A behavioural rule; several representations can implement it.","行为规则，多种表示可实现。"),
S("Arrays and dynamic arrays","数组与动态数组","<p>An array places elements in indexed slots, enabling constant-time indexed access in the usual RAM model. A dynamic array grows its backing storage when capacity runs out. A single append may copy n entries, yet geometrically increasing capacity gives amortised O(1) append: across many appends, total copies grow only linearly. Inserting at the front shifts entries and is O(n). Python lists are dynamic arrays of references, not packed arbitrary Python objects. Locality often makes sequential array scans practical despite abstractly similar costs elsewhere.</p>","<p>数组把元素放入索引槽位，在通常 RAM 模型中支持常数索引访问。动态数组容量耗尽时扩容，单次追加可能复制 n 项，但几何增长让多次追加总复制线性，因此摊还 O(1)。头部插入需移动 O(n) 项。Python 列表保存对象引用，而非直接连续存放任意对象。局部性也影响实际扫描效率。</p>","Does amortised O(1) mean every append is O(1)?","摊还 O(1) 意味着每次追加都是 O(1) 吗？","No; occasional resizing can be O(n).","不是，偶尔扩容可为 O(n)。"),
S("Linked lists and local updates","链表与局部更新","<p>A linked node stores a value and a reference to the next node. Prepending only changes a few references. Indexed access requires following links, so reaching position i costs O(i). Inserting after an already-known node is O(1), but finding that node may cost O(n). Deleting requires access to the predecessor in a singly linked list. Links consume extra memory and can reduce locality. The stack lab makes these references visible rather than hiding the implementation inside a built-in list.</p>","<p>链节点保存值和下一节点引用，头部插入只改变少量引用。访问索引 i 要沿链前进，成本 O(i)。已知节点后插入 O(1)，寻找该节点却可能 O(n)。单链表删除通常需前驱。链接增加内存且可能降低局部性；栈实验展示这些引用。</p>","Is finding and deleting an arbitrary linked item always O(1)?","寻找并删除任意链表项总是 O(1) 吗？","No, locating the item and predecessor can require a scan.","不是，定位项目与前驱可能需要扫描。"),
S("Stacks and queues","栈与队列","<p>Stacks remove the newest item first; queues remove the oldest. Undo history uses a stack; waiting tasks often use a queue. A linked stack pushes and pops at its head in O(1). A deque supports efficient operations at both ends and avoids Python list pop(0), which shifts remaining references. Empty removal needs a defined result or exception. Later, recursion uses a call stack and breadth-first graph search uses a queue; the behavioural order determines the algorithm.</p>","<p>栈先删除最新项，队列先删除最早项。撤销记录用栈，等待任务常用队列。链式栈在头部 O(1) 推入弹出。deque 支持两端高效操作，避免 list.pop(0) 移动引用。空删除需规定结果或异常。递归使用调用栈，广度搜索使用队列，行为顺序决定算法。</p>","Which structure processes requests in arrival order?","哪种结构按到达顺序处理请求？","A FIFO queue.","先进先出队列。"),
S("Hash tables, collisions and load","哈希表、碰撞与负载","<p>A hash function maps keys to bucket indices. Different keys may collide, so a table must compare original keys within a chain or use another collision strategy. Updating an existing key should replace its value rather than add a duplicate. Expected O(1) lookup depends on appropriate hashing and controlled load; worst-case chains can be O(n). The load factor is entries/buckets. Resize and rehash when necessary. Our byte-sum hash is intentionally poor: anagrams collide. Python dictionaries use a much more sophisticated implementation; do not substitute this toy for them.</p>","<p>哈希函数把键映射到桶，不同键可碰撞，因此需在链中比较原键或采用其他策略。更新现有键应替换值而非重复插入。期望 O(1) 依赖合适哈希与受控负载，最坏链长可 O(n)。负载因子为项目数除桶数，必要时扩容重哈希。实验字节和哈希故意很差，变位词碰撞；Python 字典实现更复杂。</p>","Does equal hash imply equal key?","相同哈希意味着相同键吗？","No; compare keys to distinguish collisions.","不意味着，需比较键区分碰撞。")],
labs=[dict(file="m06_structures.py",title=P("Linked stack and queue","链式栈与队列"),intro=P("Follow head and next references. Compare the removal order for identical inputs.","跟踪 head、next 引用，比较相同输入的删除顺序。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Add a peek operation without removal.</li><li>Test one push/pop and an empty queue.</li><li>Draw the chain after two pushes.</li></ol>","<ol><li>增加不删除的 peek。</li><li>测试单次推入弹出与空队列。</li><li>画出两次推入后的链。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>peek returns head.value after the same empty check, without updating head. Two pushes A then B give B→A→None. deque.popleft raises IndexError when empty.</p>","<p>peek 检查非空后返回 head.value，不更新 head。推入 A、B 后为 B→A→None，空 deque.popleft 抛 IndexError。</p>")),dict(file="m06_hash.py",title=P("Collision handling","碰撞处理"),intro=P("ab and ba share a bucket but remain different keys. The update changes ab's value without growing its chain.","ab 与 ba 同桶但键不同，更新 ab 不增加链长度。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Use one bucket and count scanned entries.</li><li>Add delete with an explicit missing-key rule.</li><li>Double bucket count and reinsert all entries.</li></ol>","<ol><li>仅用一桶，统计扫描项。</li><li>增加删除并规定缺失键行为。</li><li>桶数翻倍，重新插入所有项。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>One bucket creates a linear chain. Delete searches for a matching key and removes that pair, raising KeyError if absent. Rehash by recomputing each key's slot with the new bucket count; copying old chains unchanged is incorrect.</p>","<p>一桶产生线性链。删除需找键并移除，不存在则抛 KeyError。扩容后重新计算每个键的桶，不能照搬旧链。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"LIFO","后进先出","Push A,B,C; pop twice. What remains?","推入 A、B、C，弹出两次后剩什么？","<p>Pops C then B; A remains.</p>","<p>先 C 后 B，剩 A。</p>"),E(1,"FIFO","先进先出","Enqueue A,B,C; dequeue twice.","入队 A、B、C，出队两次。","<p>Removes A then B; C remains.</p>","<p>移除 A、B，剩 C。</p>"),E(2,"Indexed cost","索引成本","Compare reading index 500 in an array and singly linked list.","比较数组与单链表读取索引 500。","<p>Array: O(1) indexed access. Linked list: about 500 link traversals, O(n) in the general worst case.</p>","<p>数组 O(1)，链表约五百次链接遍历，一般最坏 O(n)。</p>"),E(2,"Load factor","负载因子","There are 18 entries and 8 buckets. Compute load.","十八项八桶，负载多少？","<p>18/8=2.25 entries per bucket on average; individual chains can differ greatly.</p>","<p>平均 2.25 项每桶，实际链可差很多。</p>"),E(2,"Collision proof","碰撞证明","Can every string map uniquely into 256 buckets?","所有字符串能唯一映射到 256 桶吗？","<p>No. More than 256 distinct strings force collisions by pigeonhole.</p>","<p>不能，超过 256 个字符串由鸽巢原理必碰撞。</p>"),E(3,"Amortised copies","摊还复制","If capacities double, bound total copies before capacity 16.","容量翻倍，到十六前总复制多少？","<p>1+2+4+8=15. Generally a geometric sum is less than the final doubled capacity, explaining linear total resize work.</p>","<p>1+2+4+8=15，几何和小于最终翻倍容量，说明扩容总工作线性。</p>"),E(3,"Choose a structure","选择结构","Choose for repeated lookup by immutable book ID with no sorted-order requirement.","不可变书 ID 重复查询、不要求有序，选什么？","<p>A hash map gives expected O(1) lookups; specify missing-key behaviour and key uniqueness. If ordered range queries become important, reconsider with a sorted structure.</p>","<p>哈希映射期望 O(1)，需规定缺失键与唯一性；若需要有序范围查询应重新考虑。</p>"),E(2,"Known node","已知节点","Why does O(1) insertion after a known node not mean O(1) insertion by title?","已知节点后 O(1) 插入为何不代表按书名插入 O(1)？","<p>The title query must locate the node first, potentially scanning the whole list.</p>","<p>书名查询先需定位节点，可能扫描全链。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("A stack is?","栈是什么？","LIFO","后进先出","FIFO","先进先出","Always sorted","总有序","Newest item leaves first.","最新项先离开。"),Q("list.pop(0) typically costs?","list.pop(0) 通常成本？","O(n)","O(n)","O(1)","O(1)","O(log n)","O(log n)","Remaining references shift.","剩余引用需移动。"),Q("A collision means?","碰撞意味着什么？","Different keys share a bucket","不同键同桶","Keys must be equal","键必相同","Data must be lost","必丢数据","Collision handling preserves both keys.","处理碰撞可保留双方。"),Q("Load factor is?","负载因子是什么？","Entries divided by buckets","项数除桶数","Bytes divided by titles","字节除书名","Largest key","最大键","It summarises occupancy.","它概括占用。"),Q("Linked random access is usually?","链表随机访问通常如何？","Linear in distance","随距离线性","Constant for any index","任意索引常数","Impossible","不可能","Follow next links.","需沿 next 前进。"),Q("Expected constant hash lookup requires?","期望常数查询需要什么？","Good hashing and controlled load","良好哈希与受控负载","No collisions ever","永不碰撞","Sorted input","有序输入","Worst cases can still be linear.","最坏仍可线性。")],pitfalls=[P("Counting only pointer changes omits the search needed to locate a node.","只数引用修改会遗漏定位节点的搜索。"),P("A hash is not a unique identity.","哈希不是唯一身份。")],reading=[(P("Python deque","Python deque"),"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.deque",P("Compare endpoint operations with list front removal.","比较两端操作与列表头部删除。"))],terms=[(P("ADT","抽象数据类型"),P("An operation-and-behaviour contract.","操作与行为约定。")),(P("Amortised cost","摊还成本"),P("Cost per operation averaged over a sequence with a worst-case total bound.","对具有最坏总成本界的序列分摊单次成本。")),(P("Collision","碰撞"),P("Different keys receiving the same bucket index.","不同键取得同一桶索引。"))],review=P("<p>Explain a workload where each structure is appropriate. Trace the stack's references and a collision update. Module 07 uses stacks and queues to traverse recursive structures.</p>","<p>为每种结构说明适用负载，跟踪栈引用与碰撞更新。模块 07 将用栈和队列遍历递归结构。</p>")))
